lled-by-its-implied-joins-validates (5.4 G ticks): malli compiles the derived ref schema again on every path; the validator is compiled once a schema digest (context's or data's code: agreed with them first). Deletes, root-approved only: seon.reader/definition-head and its test, seon.profile/stats-sum (accrue's assertions kept). Proofs are named as each class lands, each with its measured ticks beside its estimate."
